{
  "additionalProperties": true,
  "description": "The smallest and largest value of one integer field, for a local range comparison only.\n\nThese are real values, so they follow the rule for `ValueTokens`: they live in a collector\nbundle, a controlled transfer, never in a snapshot, a log, a trace or a model context. The\nassembler reads them to compare two fields' ranges and publishes only whether they overlap.",
  "properties": {
    "collector_version": {
      "minLength": 1,
